msgid "Auto-convert anonymous favorites on login"
msgstr "Treiñ ent emgefre ar muiañ-karet dianav pa gevreer"

#: src/Form/SiteSettingsFieldset.php:111
msgid ""
"This setting is used only when both favorites and selections are enabled for "
"the user. When enabled, the anonymous basket is appended silently to the "
"user default favorites at login. When disabled, a dialog asks the user where "
"to put them."
msgstr ""
"N'eus nemet pa vez gweredekaet war un dro ar muiañ-karet hag an dibaboù gant "
